  "reason": "Existing evidence shows that using imagenet_vit_l image encoder with weighted fusion (config_025, 0.6352 accuracy) outperforms other setups. This experiment tests transformer aggregation (vs avgpool in config_025) to isolate its impact on performance. It directly compares aggregation methods while maintaining the high-performing image encoder and fusion type, addressing uncertainty about aggregation's contribution. This is a logical extension of prior successes and clarifies a key design choice without overcomplicating the experiment."
